                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c83b061f-bd04-44e9-ba32-63d204664abd",
                                                "sense_id": "66aa9620-54d9-37b4-91b3-3c31cc9faa4d",
                                                "text": "By EDWARD CHAMBERLAYNE Dr. of Laws, and Fellow of the Royal Society."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fdc8c7d-98cd-43ca-9eed-95c3993834fb",
                                                "sense_id": "66aa9620-54d9-37b4-91b3-3c31cc9faa4d",
                                                "text": "It appears that Drs. Jones and Freeman account for the arch over the hagioscope at St. David's by saying, though without citing authorities, that there was a door there originally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a304f62-0bc2-4752-ac3c-c5c03b693e8a",
                                                "sense_id": "66aa9620-54d9-37b4-91b3-3c31cc9faa4d",
                                                "text": "Pass the chalk. Dr. Levine was there with a friend and fellow psychiatrist (detect a pattern?), Alexa Albert, Coco’s mother, who squinted up into the sun as her daughter effortlessly sailed skyward. Dr. Albert is an acrophobe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7c06b12-9f47-4f8d-921e-29ad36f26b5b",
                                                "sense_id": "66aa9620-54d9-37b4-91b3-3c31cc9faa4d",
                                                "text": "A widely shared local television video of last week's news conference, which was posted on YouTube, reached more than 5 million views and was amplified by Elon Musk and Fox News, where Dr. Dan Erickson and Dr. Artin Massihi appeared on primetime shows two nights in a row. […] \"As owners of local urgent care clinics, it appears these two individuals are releasing biased, non-peer reviewed data to advance their personal financial interests without regard for the public's health,\" the statement read, \"COVID-19 misinformation is widespread and dangerous. Members of ACEP and AAEM are first-hand witnesses to the human toll that COVID-19 is taking on our communities. ACEP and AAEM strongly advise against using any statements of Drs. Erickson and Massihi as a basis for policy and decision making.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02fa08b0-eb9a-3887-bf3f-eb9d195abde4",
                                        "entry_id": "acd57782-edbc-3522-a8a9-487ac1732580",
